{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1787515721860683ab6ff8c8da41a90e0d86b7ef5eb706ef1a6cb7c0317804b6","ja":"亜利沙ちゃん、何か見つかったの！？","zh":"亚利沙，发现什么了吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"143b211ff502420e207796dfcb5b8c0666db43088994c7a60f16c55c43329da9","ja":"はい！　これです、これ！\n『特大パワフル盛り！』","zh":"好的！就是这个，这个！\n“特大超能份量！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d2793bfee3fcc0e86e5f5ee797471740962fcf607934f174e4c32e56e66c56fb","ja":"インフルエンサーが紹介して、\nSNSでバズったのが原因だったみたいです！","zh":"好像是因为被网红介绍，\n在社交平台上爆火引起的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"243a66bc599d76200c3912403de3c458878e4b74ad64591bd514c49339e536b9","ja":"あっ、この書き込み、『佐竹飯店』のタグがない！\nだから前は、検索に引っかからなかったんだ！？","zh":"啊，这条发帖没有带“佐竹饭店”的标签！\n所以之前才没搜出来啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8f20ef33b4bfb8ff5178d3fbf03270e648cc026024b8964c94626d7076be7581","ja":"そうなんです！　メニューが注目されてから、\nお店が気になって調べる人が続出したようでして……。","zh":"就是这样！自从菜单受到关注后，\n似乎有很多人都对这家店产生了兴趣并去查阅……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"61c83e55f65c39b26fb9e6d54924a7b544a7fec9fb006f04eed8309040afb34b","ja":"言われてみたら、ボリュームのことを言ってる\n書き込みがいっぱいあったね。","zh":"经你这么一说，确实有好多\n留言都在提到音量呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4da6ffb5f6bfb1d32b7c505c22bd06cd57f685dfc5aa1fdefd7425b2e42c3365","ja":"このお店で量が多いのって、当たり前のことに\n思いすぎてて、全然気にしてなかったな……。","zh":"这家店的分量很大，之前我都觉得是理所当然的，\n完全没有在意过呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"045c61cc436dbccb0164a8323feb5d2d0efda6c0dab647e76324a6a7aa629a5b","ja":"それと、美奈子ちゃんのファンの方々が、お客さんの\n急増を心配して来店したりもしているみたいです！","zh":"而且，美奈子的粉丝们似乎也因为担心\n客流量骤增而专程来店里看望了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"7772c318d01971e476a6f4f8f60b2b6a979f46ed9cf6b23a80d41673420e0435","ja":"そっか！　それで、\nファンの人たちも増えていたんだね。","zh":"这样啊！所以\n粉丝们也变多了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7df76c6bcfae7a86c7eb724a160e73eeda00a8581c731bdfd1d173e2d4dc4e14","ja":"そうなんだ……！　お店のことも、私のことも、\n気にしてくれてる人がたくさんいるんだね。","zh":"原来是这样……！有很多人都在关心着\n店里的事，还有我的事呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0abbba9220d2a3881283e09d72a3f34afb44b254753f692d4bf7c8abe674c2e2","ja":"私も、その気持ちに応えられたら……あ！\nお客さんへのメッセージをSNSに投稿しようっと！","zh":"我也想回应这份心意……啊！\n在社交平台上给观众们发一条留言吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a159808e06626d50b79cec53de82d66a1133f0f5832e43f2e5b0ac6c139818d6","ja":"美奈子ちゃん直々のメッセージ！？\nそれは、最高のご褒美ですねっ！！","zh":"美奈子亲笔写来的留言！？\n这可真是至高无上的奖励呢！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"bd6411bcae9433d3dcdeedf7ee6cc526de16efb432a1525a580a2af53ef1c75e","ja":"ふふ……「『パワフル盛り』が話題になってから、\nお店がすごくにぎやかです！　本当にありがとう！」","zh":"呵呵……“自从‘活力特盛’成了热门话题，\n店里就变得非常热闹！真的太谢谢你们了！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"979cd62591db35a75ab5a6838111cf8fe2c9c3acd9d1218b8c09b7630919e649","ja":"「皆さん、ぜひ食べに来てください！\n佐竹飯店がこれからも、全力でおもてなしします！」","zh":"“大家一定要来尝尝看哦！\n佐竹饭店今后也会全力以赴为大家服务的！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"422d81037b2a9c61d2da7cd206601508fccfed6886ce60950007016dbcd55de1","ja":"……美奈子ちゃんは本当に素敵な店員さんだね。\nよかったら私にも、またお店を手伝わせてほしいな。","zh":"……美奈子真是个很棒的店员呢。\n可以的话，希望下次我也能再来给店里帮忙。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"8e05b8255a82738e053c09698f5d554de558f8107a4d72710446cf84f61b9266","ja":"ありさもいつでも助太刀します！　それにきっと、\n劇場のみんなも美奈子ちゃんを助けてくれるはずです！","zh":"亚利沙也随时都会来助阵！而且剧场的大家\n肯定也都会帮助美奈子的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1731.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"67aec250c7bc60222af01bb70de2e86f02ed84f895c32398b3f272321d8a3b35","ja":"ありがとう！\nそれならどれだけ忙しくなっても、大丈夫だね♪","zh":"谢谢你！\n这样一来，不管之后变得多忙都没问题了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
